WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.700
We're building a small box that measures your home internet.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:12.600
Setting it up only means plugging it into your router.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:20.800
It tests your connection every five minutes, day and night.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:28.800
Each result is saved, so you can show what you really get.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.900
It measures only your connection, never what you do online.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:41.000
Later, an AI helper will find what's wrong, help fix what it can, and back you up when your provider blames your home.

